# Tata Bahasa Aksara

Dokumen ini memakai EBNF. Simbol `{ x }` berarti nol atau lebih, `[ x ]` berarti opsional, dan `x | y` berarti alternatif.

## Program

```ebnf
program        = { statement } EOF ;
statement      = decorators ( function_def | class_def )
               | if_stmt
               | while_stmt
               | for_stmt
               | try_stmt
               | with_stmt
               | import_stmt
               | from_import
               | global_stmt
               | nonlocal_stmt
               | assert_stmt
               | delete_stmt
               | raise_stmt
               | return_stmt
               | yield_stmt
               | break_stmt
               | continue_stmt
               | pass_stmt
               | match_stmt
               | simple_stmt ;

simple_stmt    = assignment | expression_stmt ;
```

## Dekorator, fungsi, dan kelas

```ebnf
decorators     = { "@" expression NEWLINE } ;
function_def   = [ "asinkron" ] "fungsi" IDENTIFIER "(" [ parameters ] ")"
                 [ "->" expression ] ":" suite ;
class_def      = "kelas" IDENTIFIER [ "(" [ arguments ] ")" ] ":" suite ;

parameters     = parameter { "," parameter } [ "," ] ;
parameter      = NAME [ ":" expression ] [ "=" expression ]
               | "*" [ NAME [ ":" expression ] ]
               | "**" NAME [ ":" expression ]
               | "/" ;
```

## Percabangan dan perulangan

```ebnf
if_stmt        = "jika" expression ":" suite
                 { "lainnya" "jika" expression ":" suite }
                 [ "lainnya" ":" suite ] ;
while_stmt     = "selama" expression ":" suite [ "lainnya" ":" suite ] ;
for_stmt       = [ "asinkron" ] "untuk" target for_source ":" suite
                 [ "lainnya" ":" suite ] ;
for_source     = "dalam" expression
               | "setiap" expression
               | "sebanyak" expression
               | "dari" expression "sampai" expression
                 [ "langkah" expression ] ;
target         = expression ;
```

`setiap`, `sebanyak`, `sampai`, dan `langkah` adalah kata kunci kontekstual. Parser hanya mengenalinya pada posisi di atas.

## Eksepsi dan context manager

```ebnf
try_stmt       = "coba" ":" suite
                 { "tangkap" [ expression [ "sebagai" NAME ] ] ":" suite }
                 [ "lainnya" ":" suite ]
                 [ "akhirnya" ":" suite ] ;
with_stmt      = [ "asinkron" ] "dengan" with_item { "," with_item } ":" suite ;
with_item      = expression [ "sebagai" target ] ;
raise_stmt     = "lempar" [ expression [ "dari" expression ] ] ;
```

## Impor

```ebnf
import_stmt    = "impor" import_target { "," import_target } ;
import_target  = python_target | dotted_name [ "sebagai" NAME ] ;
python_target  = "python" STRING [ "sebagai" NAME ] ;

from_import    = "dari" ( python_target | relative_module ) "impor"
                 ( "*" | import_name { "," import_name } ) ;
import_name    = NAME [ "sebagai" NAME ] ;
relative_module = { "." } dotted_name ;
dotted_name    = NAME { "." NAME } ;
```

## Pernyataan sederhana

```ebnf
assignment     = target_list ( "=" target_list )* "=" expression_list
               | target ":" expression [ "=" expression ]
               | target aug_op expression ;
aug_op         = "+=" | "-=" | "*=" | "/=" | "//=" | "%=" | "**=" | "@="
               | "&=" | "|=" | "^=" | "<<=" | ">>=" | "??=" ;
expression_stmt = expression_list ;
target_list    = target { "," target } [ "," ] ;
expression_list = expression { "," expression } [ "," ] ;

global_stmt    = "global" NAME { "," NAME } ;
nonlocal_stmt  = "nonlokal" NAME { "," NAME } ;
assert_stmt    = "pastikan" expression [ "," expression ] ;
delete_stmt    = "hapus" target { "," target } ;
return_stmt    = "kembalikan" [ expression ] ;
yield_stmt     = "hasilkan" [ "dari" ] [ expression ] ;
break_stmt     = "hentikan" ;
continue_stmt  = "lanjutkan" ;
pass_stmt      = "lewati" ;
```

## Pencocokan pola

```ebnf
match_stmt     = "cocokkan" expression ":" NEWLINE INDENT
                 { "kasus" pattern [ "jika" expression ] ":" suite }
                 DEDENT ;
pattern        = or_pattern ;
or_pattern     = closed_pattern { "|" closed_pattern } ;
closed_pattern = literal_pattern
               | wildcard_pattern
               | capture_pattern
               | sequence_pattern
               | mapping_pattern
               | class_pattern ;
literal_pattern = NUMBER | STRING | "benar" | "salah" | "kosong" ;
wildcard_pattern = "_" ;
capture_pattern = NAME ;
sequence_pattern = "[" [ pattern { "," pattern } [ "," ] ] "]"
                 | "(" [ pattern { "," pattern } [ "," ] ] ")" ;
mapping_pattern = "{" [ mapping_item { "," mapping_item } [ "," ] ] "}" ;
mapping_item    = expression ":" pattern | "**" NAME ;
class_pattern   = NAME "(" [ pattern { "," pattern } ]
                  { NAME "=" pattern } ")" ;
```

## Suite dan pernyataan sederhana

```ebnf
suite          = ":" ( NEWLINE INDENT { statement } DEDENT
                    | simple_stmt { ";" simple_stmt } NEWLINE ) ;
```

## Ekspresi

Prioritas dari rendah ke tinggi:

```ebnf
expression     = lambda_expr | walrus_expr | ternary_expr ;
lambda_expr    = "lambda" [ parameters ] ":" expression ;
walrus_expr    = ternary_expr [ ":=" expression ] ;
ternary_expr   = null_coalesce [ "jika" null_coalesce "lainnya" expression ] ;
null_coalesce  = or_expr { "??" or_expr } ;
or_expr        = and_expr { "atau" and_expr } ;
and_expr       = not_expr { "dan" not_expr } ;
not_expr       = "bukan" not_expr | comparison ;
comparison     = bit_or { compare_op bit_or } ;
compare_op     = "==" | "!=" | "<" | "<=" | ">" | ">="
               | "dalam" | "bukan" "dalam"
               | "adalah" | "bukan" "adalah"
               | "antara" bit_or "dan" bit_or
               | "bukan" "antara" bit_or "dan" bit_or ;
bit_or         = bit_xor { "|" bit_xor } ;
bit_xor        = bit_and { "^" bit_and } ;
bit_and        = shift { "&" shift } ;
shift          = sum { ( "<<" | ">>" ) sum } ;
sum            = term { ( "+" | "-" ) term } ;
term           = factor { ( "*" | "/" | "//" | "%" | "@" ) factor } ;
factor         = ( "+" | "-" | "~" ) factor | power ;
power          = await_expr [ "**" factor ] ;
await_expr     = "tunggu" await_expr | postfix ;
postfix        = primary { call | subscript | attribute } ;
```

## Primary

```ebnf
primary        = NAME
               | NUMBER
               | STRING
               | "benar" | "salah" | "kosong"
               | "..." 
               | "(" [ expression_list | comprehension ] ")"
               | "[" [ expression_list | comprehension ] "]"
               | "{" [ dict_or_set ] "}" ;

call           = "(" [ arguments ] ")" | "?(" [ arguments ] ")" ;
arguments      = argument { "," argument } [ "," ] ;
argument       = expression
               | NAME "=" expression
               | "*" expression
               | "**" expression ;

subscript      = "[" subscript_item "]" | "?[" subscript_item "]" ;
subscript_item = expression | slice | expression_list ;
slice          = [ expression ] ":" [ expression ] [ ":" [ expression ] ] ;

attribute      = "." NAME | "?." NAME ;

comprehension  = expression "untuk" comp_for { comp_clause } ;
comp_for       = [ "asinkron" ] "untuk" target "dalam" expression ;
comp_clause    = comp_for | "jika" expression ;
```

## Aturan tambahan

- `antara` tidak dapat dirangkai dengan perbandingan lain tanpa tanda kurung.
- `??` hanya memeriksa `kosong`, bukan nilai salah.
- `?.`, `?[]`, dan `?()` hanya melindungi penerima langsung.
- Penugasan adalah pernyataan, bukan ekspresi.
- `:=` mengikat nama di scope sekitarnya.
- Koma di akhir selalu diizinkan pada daftar, argumen, parameter, dan pola.
